	key[]: "trailer_dealer_invalid_country"
	val[]: "선택한 $ACC$은(는) <color value=@@clr_sel@@>$COUNTRIES$<color value=@@clr_txt@@>에 차고가 없으면 구매할 수 없습니다." #+ A warning shown when player tries to change trailer chain type or chassis configuration of trailer from dealer to one that's not valid for countries of garages he owns.


